WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
[Kiɗan piano da ƙungiyar kayan kiɗa mai daɗi]

00:00.850 --> 00:02.318
Yana zuwa wannan kaka.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.796
Ya san yadda suka yi halin kirki.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.542
Ya san jerin burinsu.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.160
Ya san sunansu.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.236
Haɗu da Santa ta wata sabuwar hanya.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
[Ƙaramin ƙararrawa. Ƙararrawar keken dusar ƙanƙara.]
